.flowmark/
build/
var/
/flowmark
# The root packages of package-lock.json, @polyspec/kit among them (make install-packages).
/node_modules/
/.results/
# The go.work of each Go module that kit link writes (link asserts that Git ignores it). The root go.work lists the Go
# modules of the repository and is tracked.
go.work
!/go.work
go.work.sum
# The environment that uv makes for a lock project, such as the vulture lock under .mise/locks.
.venv/
# The link declaration of the checkout (K869): the provider checkouts that make link names, one path per line.
/.links
